任务执行。它将用户意图与具体目标、约束及验证条件分离，在模型权重保持不变的前提下通过持久化的运行时状态和控制策略实现自我演化。","title":"Argus: A General-Purpose Agentic Runtime for Long-Horizon Reasoning"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_fe2738fc7f35759fe0641cfd84148039e51dfcbcdf56c91a3c325e069fa2dac2","internal_url":"/posts/20260806-arxiv-toward-skill-native-llms-skill-entropy-for-benchma-1-7b6085fd24/","observation_id":"obs_7b6085fd248fee2308ff1b2e6cdb1b2dd150989f06adde5239ef0a2feb7bea43","published_at":"2026-08-05T17:57:16Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"该内容提出一种量化推理过程中技能切换难度的指标，并在此基础上构建了包含跨技能长时推理任务的评测基准，同时将该指标转化为强化学习训练信号，用于提升模型在复杂推理链中的技能切换能力。","title":"Toward Skill-Native LLMs: Skill Entropy for Benchmarking and Training Long-Horizon Reasoning"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_2af9b98df4c93e46d21b78b907cf62234e7b6a1007e1b448ecb2769c5e5e580a","internal_url":"/posts/20260805-hacker_news-position-llms-cant-jump-0-7d703edcfc/","observation_id":"obs_7d703edcfc16cd09ee95dcc98a621a78c97406cfa0bfe7b542ec1c795401b96f","published_at":"2026-08-05T11:01:37Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"hacker_news","summary":"当前只保存了标题与来源元数据，未抓取外链全文。请以原始来源和 Hacker News 讨论为准。","title":"Position: LLMs Can't Jump"}],"graph_node_id":"tag:大语言模型","id":"tag:大语言模型","related_topics":[{"cooccurrence":54,"graph_node_id":"tag:AI Agent","id":"tag:AI Agent","jaccard":0.580645,"topic":"AI Agent"},{"cooccurrence":22,"graph_node_id":"tag:Prompt 工程","id":"tag:Prompt 工程","jaccard":0.236559,"topic":"Prompt 工程"},{"cooccurrence":12,"graph_node_id":"tag:生成式 AI","id":"tag:生成式 AI","jaccard":0.129032,"topic":"生成式 AI"},{"cooccurrence":11,"graph_node_id":"tag:Amazon Bedrock AgentCore","id":"tag:Amazon Bedrock AgentCore","jaccard":0.11828,"topic":"Amazon Bedrock AgentCore"},{"cooccurrence":9,"graph_node_id":"tag:Amazon Bedrock","id":"tag:Amazon Bedrock","jaccard":0.096774,"topic":"Amazon Bedrock"},{"cooccurrence":9,"graph_node_id":"tag:机器学习","id":"tag:机器学习","jaccard":0.096774,"topic":"机器学习"},{"cooccurre